date-released: 2026-07-02
abstract: >-
  Deterministic, client-side coherence-audit tools: a function-first
  plain-language glossary of agentic AI and its governance, a framework
  audit scoring coherence and resilience on eight dimensions, a gap
  check for plans and policies, and an ordering-drift detector for
  agent traces, together with the Resilience Ledger method documents
  and calibration logs. No model or network is required at runtime;
  all detector lexicons are versioned and openly displayed.
keywords:
  - coherence audit
  - agentic AI governance
  - ordering drift
  - deterministic evaluation
  - plain-language glossary
  - resilience ledger